B.aKK=s(["Tap a quest to read its instructions, then complete it to earn XP based on its rank. Leveling up advances your title and increases your HP and available Ability Points (AP).","Daily quests are assigned to selected weekdays and are intended for that day. Main quests are larger, longer-term goals; Side quests are additional or supporting goals. Both Main and Side quests can have optional deadlines.","For a Main or Side quest, add one or more specific due dates. A scheduled quest appears on the Labyrinth board only on its selected dates. You can complete it once on each date; completing one date does not clear its later dates. The optional time applies to every selected date, and defaults to 11:59 PM local time. Any unfinished occurrence moves to Cemetery after its deadline.","Open Instant Dungeon in the drawer and choose Summon to add, edit, or remove short-term quests. Active summons also appear at the top of the Labyrinth quest list and are due at 11:59 PM local time on the day they are added.","Open Cemetery from the drawer to review missed quests, grouped by Instant Dungeon, Main, and Side. Tap a cemetery entry to reveal its saved instructions; cemetery quests are kept for reference and cannot be completed from there.","Complete at least one quest in a day to build or maintain your streak. Cleared quests play the System\u2019s check-and-burn effect. Completed quests are recorded in Quest Activity.","In Quest Activity, long-press a completed quest to add a copy to Main, Side, or Instant Dungeon. The copy keeps its title, rank, and available instructions; you can choose a new optional deadline for a Main or Side copy.","Use Missions to view your progression roadmap, Guild to see its schedule, and Reward Shop to exchange earned rank tokens for rewards.","The drawer also contains Notes, History, Summary reports, Theme, Mail, account controls, and your optional Goal Doc link."],t.s)
B.b5r=new A.kw(B.ma,"LABYRINTH","Turn daily goals into quests and Monarch progression.",B.n,B.aKK)
