B.aKu=s(["Add and edit ingredients and recipes. Tap a recipe to see its ingredients, method, and notes; long-press an item to make a copy.","Log food from a recipe or enter it manually. Your daily intake keeps the time and source of each entry, alongside calorie, carbohydrate, protein, and sugar totals.","Dietary Analysis shows your intake trends. Sleep Analysis lets you start a timer when you go to sleep and stop it when you wake, or enter sleep times manually.","Save multiple sleep sessions on the same wake-up date, including naps. Long-press a recent sleep log to edit or delete it. Swipe between weekly and monthly sleep graphs.","A Goal Night is a day with 7\u20139 total hours of sleep; separate sessions and naps on that date are added together.","Open Summary in the Labyrinth drawer to choose Calorie Intake, Quest Activity, or Sleep and download a report. Calorie reports include your name, title, age, BMI, totals, and date-grouped intake; Quest reports show quests cleared and HP/XP earned; Sleep reports include player details, monthly graph, totals, and session details.","Use Shopping Notes to keep a list of items to buy. Status and System Mail can remind you to review your body measurements."],t.s)
B.b5q=new A.kw(B.rw,"NUTRITION","Plan food, record intake, and review nutrition and sleep.",B.KE,B.aKu)
B.a0C=new A.b9(62440,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aLA=s(["Create a note with a title and text, pin important notes, and delete notes you no longer need.","For a bulleted list, start a line with an asterisk and a space. Press Enter to continue the list, or press Enter on an empty bullet to leave list mode.","Notes are saved with your player profile and included when you sync."],t.s)
B.b5p=new A.kw(B.a0C,"NOTES","Keep reminders and reference notes in one place.",B.ac,B.aLA)
B.aLq=s(["Add a link with a title, then search your saved links when you need one.","Reorder or edit saved links, and remove entries you no longer use.","Open links in the in-app viewer when supported; otherwise, the app offers your browser."],t.s)
B.b5s=new A.kw(B.z9,"LIBRARY","Save useful links so you can find them again.",B.aI,B.aLq)
B.a0n=new A.b9(58475,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aK2=s(["Choose a different background image for Labyrinth, Nutrition, Library, and Status.","Adjust the dim overlay to keep text readable over your images. You can also remove an image to return to the default background.","Open Theme in the Labyrinth drawer and save your changes when you are done."],t.s)
B.b5o=new A.kw(B.a0n,"THEME","Personalize the look of each main app tab.",B.ac,B.aK2)
